# Animation rules — PokeSlider

## Libraries

- **Motion** (`motion/react`) for `AnimatePresence`, `motion.div`, layout props when reduced motion allows.
- Pair with **`motionPrefs.ts`**: `overlayBackdropTransition`, `dialogSpringTransition`, `sheetSpringTransition`, `layoutTransition` — always pass `usePrefersReducedMotion()` result.

## CSS

- Token-backed durations: `duration-[var(--duration-normal)]`, easing `var(--ease-out)`.
- Global body atmosphere: gradient hue shift only when `prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference` (see `index.css`).

## Carousel

- Halo: `.motion-carousel-halo` — disabled under reduced motion.
- No infinite “pulse glow” on active ball — single elevation shadow token.

## Don’t

- Add second animation frameworks.
- Animate layout properties on large lists without measuring (prefer opacity/transform).
